Relay Claude Code Channel

This repository selectively migrated reusable foundations from
RelayMessenger/Relay-SDK commit 0ff1fb1, path integrations/claude-code, under
the accompanying MIT license. The Relay v1 implementation was rebuilt against
@relaymessenger/sdk 0.3.0-staging.8 and the contract lock recorded in
contracts/relay-v1.lock.json.

